# Data Room — architecture & code style

SPA: Vite 8 + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui. Persistence via Nest/Mongo HTTP API (`fetch`). No IndexedDB.

## Folder layout (`src/`)

| Path | Put here |
|------|----------|
| `types/` | Domain types only (`FolderNode`, `FileNode`, …) |
| `constants/` | Literals (`PDF_*`, `API_BASE_URL`, `MAX_NODE_NAME_LENGTH`, …) |
| `helpers/` | Pure functions (names, files, search, format, download, nodes, `cn`) |
| `storage/` | HTTP client + repositories (no React) |
| `store/` | `DataroomContext` / `useDataroom` |
| `hooks/` | Route/search UI hooks |
| `pages/` | Route screens |
| `components/{browser,dialogs,layout,navigation,preview}/` | Feature UI |
| `components/ui/` | shadcn primitives (do not invent parallel UI kits) |
| `lib/utils.ts` | shadcn bridge only — re-exports `cn` |

Prefer barrel imports: `@/types`, `@/helpers`, `@/constants`. Alias `@/*` → `src/*`.

## Domain

- Flat tree: `DataroomNode` with `parentId: NodeId | null` (`null` = root).
- Files are PDF-only (`mimeType: 'application/pdf'`). Blob bytes come from `GET /api/nodes/:id/content`.
- Unique sibling names (case-insensitive) via `uniqueNameAmong` → `Name (1).pdf` (also enforce on server).
- Delete cascades descendants + blobs on the server (`DELETE /api/nodes/:id`).
- Sort: folders first; UI can sort by name / size / date (`sortNodesBy`).

## Layering rules

```
pages/components → hooks/store → helpers/constants/types
store → storage → fetch (HTTP API)
```

- Do **not** put React in `storage/` or business logic in `components/ui/`.
- New pure logic → `helpers/`; new literals → `constants/`; new shapes → `types/`.
- Mutations go through `DataroomContext` (API write + local state + toast).

## API surface (expected backend)

- `GET /api/nodes` → `DataroomNode[]`
- `POST /api/nodes/folders` `{ name, parentId }` → `FolderNode`
- `POST /api/nodes/files` multipart (`file`, `name`, `parentId`) → `FileNode`
- `PATCH /api/nodes/:id` `{ name }` → `DataroomNode`
- `DELETE /api/nodes/:id` → `{ deletedIds: NodeId[] }`
- `GET /api/nodes/:id/content` → PDF bytes

## Code style

- Functional React components; hooks for reusable UI logic.
- App code: `import { cn, … } from '@/helpers'`.
- shadcn UI files: keep `import { cn } from '@/lib/utils'`.
- `FileList` → use `Array.from(files)`, not `[...files]`.
- Colocate tests: `*.test.ts(x)` next to source (Vitest + Testing Library; mock `fetch` / repository).
- Match existing naming: PascalCase components, camelCase functions/hooks.
- Do not add demos/seeds, unused deps, or drive-by refactors outside the task.
- Prefer native `fetch` over axios unless interceptors/auth client features are required.

## Product constraints (do not break)

- PDF only on upload/drop; reject others with toast.
- Sanitize names; max length from `MAX_NODE_NAME_LENGTH`.
- Search is global name substring; clearing folder changes clears search; create/upload disabled while searching.
- Routes: `/` and `/folder/:folderId`.
